font-family="system-ui" font-size="9" fill="#475569">Locked. Static. Nickel-and-dimed.</text><text x="125" y="420" text-anchor="middle" font-family="system-ui" font-size="8" fill="#475569" opacity="0.5">Single-stage approvals + Zapier dependency</text></g><line x1="250" y1="20" x2="250" y2="420" stroke="#5eead4" stroke-width="2" opacity="0.3"></line><g opacity="0" style="transform-origin:50% 50%;transform:scale(0.7);transform-box:fill-box"><circle cx="250" cy="220" r="16" fill="#134e4a" stroke="#5eead4" stroke-width="2"></circle><text x="250" y="224" text-anchor="middle" font-family="system-ui" font-size="10" fill="#5eead4" font-weight="800">vs</text></g><rect x="270" y="0" width="250" height="440" rx="16" fill="white"></rect><rect x="270" y="0" width="250" height="44" rx="16" fill="#f0fdfa"></rect><rect x="270" y="28" width="250" height="16" fill="#f0fdfa"></rect><text x="290" y="30" font-family="system-ui" font-size="12" fill="#134e4a" font-weight="700" opacity="0" style="transform:translateY(16px);transform-origin:50% 50%;transform-box:fill-box">Lever Platform</text><g opacity="0" style="transform:translateY(12px);transform-origin:50% 50%;transform-box:fill-box"><rect x="286" y="56" width="218" height="30" rx="8" fill="#f0fdfa" stroke="#5eead4" stroke-width="0.5"></rect><rect x="294" y="64" width="14" height="14" rx="4" fill="#14b8a6"></rect><path d="M297 71l2 2 4-4" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" fill="none"></path><text x="316" y="76" font-family="system-ui" font-size="10" fill="#134e4a" font-weight="600">Applied</text><text x="494" y="76" text-anchor="end" font-family="system-ui" font-size="10" fill="#0d9488" font-weight="700">0</text></g><g opacity="0" style="transform:translateY(12px);transform-origin:50% 50%;transform-box:fill-box"><rect x="286" y="96" width="218" height="30" rx="8" fill="#f0fdfa" stroke="#5eead4" stroke-width="0.5"></rect><rect x="294" y="104" width="14" height="14" rx="4" fill="#14b8a6"></rect><path d="M297 111l2 2 4-4" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" fill="none"></path><text x="316" y="116" font-family="system-ui" font-size="10" fill="#134e4a" font-weight="600">Screened</text><text x="494" y="116" text-anchor="end" font-family="system-ui" font-size="10" fill="#0d9488" font-weight="700">0</text></g><g opacity="0" style="transform:translateY(12px);transform-origin:50% 50%;transform-box:fill-box"><rect x="286" y="136" width="218" height="30" rx="8" fill="#f0fdfa" stroke="#5eead4" stroke-width="0.5"></rect><rect x="294" y="144" width="14" height="14" rx="4" fill="#14b8a6"></rect><path d="M297 151l2 2 4-4" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" fill="none"></path><text x="316" y="156" font-family="system-ui" font-size="10" fill="#134e4a" font-weight="600">Interview</text><text x="494" y="156" text-anchor="end" font-family="system-ui" font-size="10" fill="#0d9488" font-weight="700">0</text></g><g opacity="0" style="transform:translateY(12px);transform-origin:50% 50%;transform-box:fill-box"><rect x="286" y="176" width="218" height="30" rx="8" fill="#f0fdfa" stroke="#5eead4" stroke-width="0.5"></rect><rect x="294" y="184" width="14" height="14" rx="4" fill="#14b8a6"></rect><path d="M297 191l2 2 4-4" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" fill="none"></path><text x="316" y="196" font-family="system-ui" font-size="10" fill="#134e4a" font-weight="600">Offer</text><text x="494" y="196" text-anchor="end" font-family="system-ui" font-size="10" fill="#0d9488" font-weight="700">0</text></g><g opacity="0" style="transform:translateY(14px);transform-origin:50% 50%;transform-box:fill-box"><rect x="286" y="222" width="218" height="60" rx="10" fill="#f0fdfa" stroke="#14b8a6" stroke-width="0.5"></rect><path d="M300 244l2 4 4 2-4 2-2 4-2-4-4-2 4-2z" fill="#14b8a6" style="transform-origin:302px 248px"></path><text x="314" y="248" font-family="system-ui" font-size="9" fill="#134e4a" font-weight="700">AI Screening Companion</text><text x="300" y="268" font-family="system-ui" font-size="8" fill="#6b7280">Top candidate: Sarah Chen — 94% match</text></g><g opacity="0" style="transform:translateY(14px);transform-origin:50% 50%;transform-box:fill-box"><text x="290" y="308" font-family="system-ui" font-size="8" fill="#94a3b8">Time to Fill</text><text x="290" y="328" font-family="system-ui" font-size="18" fill="#134e4a" font-weight="800">0d</text><text x="370" y="308" font-family="system-ui" font-size="8" fill="#94a3b8">Quality</text><text x="370" y="328" font-family="system-ui" font-size="18" fill="#134e4a" font-weight="800">0%</text><text x="440" y="308" font-family="system-ui" font-size="8" fill="#94a3b8">ROI</text><text x="440" y="328" font-family="system-ui" font-size="18" fill="#14b8a6" font-weight="800">0%</text></g><g opacity="0" style="transform-origin:50% 50%;transform:scale(0.8);transform-box:fill-box"><rect x="286" y="348" width="80" height="22" rx="11" fill="#d1fae5"></rect><text x="326" y="363" text-anchor="middle" font-family="system-ui" font-size="8" fill="#065f46" font-weight="600">AI Governed</text></g><g opacity="0" style="transform-origin:50% 50%;transform:scale(0.8);transform-box:fill-box"><rect x="374" y="348" width="60" height="22" rx="11" fill="#ccfbf1"></rect><text x="404" y="363" text-anchor="middle" font-family="system-ui" font-size="8" fill="#134e4a" font-weight="600">TCPA</text></g><g opacity="0" style="transform-origin:50% 50%;transform:scale(0.8);transform-box:fill-box"><rect x="442" y="348" width="60" height="22" rx="11" fill="#ccfbf1"></rect><text x="472" y="363" text-anchor="middle" font-family="system-ui" font-size="8" fill="#134e4a" font-weight="600">EEOC</text></g><g opacity="0" style="transform:translateY(12px);transform-origin:50% 50%;transform-box:fill-box"><text x="395" y="400" text-anchor="middle" font-family="system-ui" font-size="9" fill="#0d9488" font-weight="600">Structured. Scalable. AI-Powered.</text><text x="395" y="420" text-anchor="middle" font-family="system-ui" font-size="8" fill="#94a3b8">One platform for the full hiring lifecycle</text></g></svg></div></div></div></div></section><section class="bg-white py-20 lg:py-28"><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><div class="scroll-reveal mx-auto mb-14 max-w-2xl text-center"><p class="text-primary-600 mb-3 text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] uppercase">Top Ashby Alternative</p><h2 class="text-primary-900 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl">Why Teams Switch from Ashby to Lever</h2><p class="text-primary-600 mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed">Lever is a holistic hiring platform that balances power with user-friendliness. Unlike Ashby, Lever delivers a flexible solution that scales smoothly as your hiring needs grow.</p></div><div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-5"><div class="scroll-reveal reveal-delay-1 border-primary-200 w-full rounded-2xl border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg sm:w-[calc(50%-10px)] lg:w-[calc(33.333%-14px)] xl:w-[calc(25%-15px)]"><div class="bg-primary-50 mb-4 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl"><svg class="text-primary-700 h-5 w-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-primary-900 text-base font-bold">Enterprise-Grade Workflows Built for Scale</h3><p class="text-primary-600 mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed">Ashby locks you into single-stage approvals. Lever allows HR, finance, and hiring managers to move candidates forward without bottlenecks.</p></div><div class="scroll-reveal reveal-delay-2 border-primary-200 w-full rounded-2xl border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg sm:w-[calc(50%-10px)] lg:w-[calc(33.333%-14px)] xl:w-[calc(25%-15px)]"><div class="bg-primary-50 mb-4 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl"><svg class="text-primary-700 h-5 w-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-primary-900 text-base font-bold">Requisitions That Drive Business Growth</h3><p class="text-primary-600 mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed">Where Ashby only offers basic tracking, Lever provides structured requisition approvals and headcount tracking so you can align hiring directly with your business goals.</p></div><div class="scroll-reveal reveal-delay-3 border-primary-200 w-full rounded-2xl border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg sm:w-[calc(50%-10px)] lg:w-[calc(33.333%-14px)] xl:w-[calc(25%-15px)]"><div class="bg-primary-50 mb-4 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl"><svg class="text-primary-700 h-5 w-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-primary-900 text-base font-bold">Nurture and Convert Candidates Faster</h3><p class="text-primary-600 mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed">While Ashby stops at active recruiting, Lever turns passive talent into active pipelines with AI-powered rediscovery, segmentation, and multi-channel nurture campaigns.</p></div><div class="scroll-reveal reveal-delay-1 border-primary-200 w-full rounded-2xl border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg sm:w-[calc(50%-10px)] lg:w-[calc(33.333%-14px)] xl:w-[calc(25%-15px)]"><div class="bg-primary-50 mb-4 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl"><svg class="text-primary-700 h-5 w-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-primary-900 text-base font-bold">Integrations Without the Headaches</h3><p class="text-primary-600 mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed">Unlike Ashby, Lever offers 300+ native, professionally-maintained integrations that effortlessly enhance your tech stack — no Zapier workarounds needed.</p></div><div class="scroll-reveal reveal-delay-2 border-primary-200 w-full rounded-2xl border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg sm:w-[calc(50%-10px)] lg:w-[calc(33.333%-14px)] xl:w-[calc(25%-15px)]"><div class="bg-primary-50 mb-4 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl"><svg class="text-primary-700 h-5 w-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-primary-900 text-base font-bold">Analytics That Give You Instant Clarity</h3><p class="text-primary-600 mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed">Unlike Ashby&#x27;s static reporting, Lever delivers interactive dashboards, predictive analytics, and customizable role-based views so you always know where your pipeline stands.</p></div><div class="scroll-reveal reveal-delay-3 border-primary-200 w-full rounded-2xl border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg sm:w-[calc(50%-10px)] lg:w-[calc(33.333%-14px)] xl:w-[calc(25%-15px)]"><div class="bg-primary-50 mb-4 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl"><svg class="text-primary-700 h-5 w-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-primary-900 text-base font-bold">Scalable for Any Organization Size</h3><p class="text-primary-600 mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed">Ashby best fits teams with simpler hiring needs. Lever scales elegantly from high-growth startups to global enterprises without sacrificing usability.</p></div><div class="scroll-reveal reveal-delay-1 border-primary-200 w-full rounded-2xl border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg sm:w-[calc(50%-10px)] lg:w-[calc(33.333%-14px)] xl:w-[calc(25%-15px)]"><div class="bg-primary-50 mb-4 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl"><svg class="text-primary-700 h-5 w-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-primary-900 text-base font-bold">Integrated AI Tools Built for Hiring</h3><p class="text-primary-600 mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed">Lever has built-in AI companions that streamline interview management, screening, and sourcing. Plus, automated features come standard so you can focus on hiring.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="border-primary-100/40 border-y bg-gray-50/50 py-20 lg:py-28"><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><div class="scroll-reveal mx-auto mb-14 max-w-2xl text-center"><p class="text-primary-600 mb-3 text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] uppercase">More Ashby Alternatives</p><h2 class="text-primary-900 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl">Still Shopping? Start Here.</h2></div><div class="space-y-8"><div class="scroll-reveal reveal-delay-1 border-primary-100/60 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border bg-white shadow-sm"><div class="border-primary-100/60 from-primary-50/50 border-b bg-gradient-to-r to-white px-6 py-5 sm:px-8"><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="bg-primary-100 text-primary-700 flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full text-sm font-bold">2</span><h3 class="text-primary-900 text-xl font-bold">JazzHR</h3></div><p class="text-primary-600 mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed">JazzHR is an affordable, lightweight ATS designed for startups and small companies. While it&#x27;s easy to use and budget-friendly, it lacks the automation, CRM features, and analytics that scaling teams require.</p></div><div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2"><div class="border-primary-100/40 flex items-center justify-center border-b p-6 sm:p-8 lg:border-r lg:border-b-0"><div class="relative w-full overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-gray-200 shadow-md"><img alt="JazzHR platform screenshot" loading="lazy" width="1024" height="600" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-auto w-full object-cover" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Falternatives%2Fashby%2Fjazzhr-new.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Falternatives%2Fashby%2Fjazzhr-new.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Falternatives%2Fashby%2Fjazzhr-new.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75"/></div></div><div class="p-6 sm:p-8"><div class="mb-6"><p class="mb-3 text-xs font-semibold tracking-wide text-emerald-700 uppercase">Features</p><ul class="space-y-2"><li class="text-primary-600 flex items-start gap-2 text-sm"><svg class="mt-0.5 h-3.5 w-3.5 flex-shrink-0 text-emerald-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>Budget-friendly hiring power built for lean teams</li><li class="text-primary-600 flex items-start gap-2 text-sm"><svg class="mt-0.5 h-3.5 w-3.5 flex-shrink-0 text-emerald-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>Effortless job posting to free and paid job boards with one click</li><li class="text-primary-600 flex items-start gap-2 text-sm"><svg class="mt-0.5 h-3.5 w-3.5 flex-shrink-0 text-emerald-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>Streamlined candidate tracking with drag-and-drop pipelines</li><li class="text-primary-600 flex items-start gap-2 text-sm"><svg class="mt-0.5 h-3.5 w-3.5 flex-shrink-0 text-emerald-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>Customizable workflows with tailored stages, templates, and offer letters</li><li class="text-primary-600 flex items-start gap-2 text-sm"><svg class="mt-0.5 h-3.5 w-3.5 flex-shrink-0 text-emerald-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>Collaboration made easy with multiple team seats and centralized feedback tools</li></ul></div><div class="border-primary-100/40 border-t pt-4"><p class="text-primary-700 text-sm font-medium"><span class="text-primary-900 font-semibold">Pricing:<!-- --> </span>JazzHR starts at just $75/month.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="scroll-reveal reveal-delay-2 border-primary-100/60 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border bg-white shadow-sm"><div class="border-primary-100/60 from-primary-50/50 border-b bg-gradient-to-r to-white px-6 py-5 sm:px-8"><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="bg-primary-100 text-primary-700 flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full text-sm font-bold">3</span><h3 class="text-primary-900 text-xl font-bold">iCIMS</h3></div><p class="text-primary-600 mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed">iCIMS is an ATS provider widely used by global organizations. While it offers a broad feature set, many teams find the workflows complex, reporting rigid, and pricing unpredictable compared to modern platforms like Lever.</p></div><div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2"><div class="border-primary-100/40 flex items-center justify-center border-b p-6 sm:p-8 lg:border-r lg:border-b-0"><div class="relative w-full overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-gray-200 shadow-md"><img alt="iCIMS platform screenshot" loading="lazy" width="1024" height="600" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-auto w-full object-cover" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Falternatives%2Fashby%2Ficims.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Falternatives%2Fashby%2Ficims.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Falternatives%2Fashby%2Ficims.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75"/></div></div><div class="p-6 sm:p-8"><div class="mb-6"><p class="mb-3 text-xs font-semibold tracking-wide text-emerald-700 uppercase">Features</p><ul class="space-y-2"><li class="text-primary-600 flex items-start gap-2 text-sm"><svg class="mt-0.5 h-3.5 w-3.5 flex-shrink-0 text-emerald-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>Comprehensive applicant tracking tools</li><li class="text-primary-600 flex items-start gap-2 text-sm"><svg class="mt-0.5 h-3.5 w-3.5 flex-shrink-0 text-emerald-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>AI-driven talent matching and resume review</li><li class="text-primary-600 flex items-start gap-2 text-sm"><svg class="mt-0.5 h-3.5 w-3.5 flex-shrink-0 text-emerald-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>Expansive integration landscape</li></ul></div><div class="mb-6"><p class="mb-3 text-xs font-semibold tracking-wide text-amber-700 uppercase">Limitations</p><ul class="space-y-2"><li class="text-primary-500 flex items-start gap-2 text-sm"><span class="mt-1 flex h-3.5 w-3.5 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-amber-100"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-400"></span></span>Complex interface that presents a steep learning curve</li><li class="text-primary-500 flex items-start gap-2 text-sm"><span class="mt-1 flex h-3.5 w-3.5 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-amber-100"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-400"></span></span>Users report difficulty separating passive and active candidates</li><li class="text-primary-500 flex items-start gap-2 text-sm"><span class="mt-1 flex h-3.5 w-3.5 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-amber-100"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-400"></span></span>Users report that automated features don&#x27;t consistently work</li></ul></div><div class="border-primary-100/40 border-t pt-4"><p class="text-primary-700 text-sm font-medium"><span class="text-primary-900 font-semibold">Pricing:<!-- --> </span>Reach out to iCIMS directly for pricing information.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="scroll-reveal reveal-delay-1 border-primary-100/60 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border bg-white shadow-sm"><div class="border-primary-100/60 from-primary-50/50 border-b bg-gradient-to-r to-white px-6 py-5 sm:px-8"><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="bg-primary-100 text-primary-700 flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full text-sm font-bold">4</span><h3 class="text-primary-900 text-xl font-bold">Workable</h3></div><p class="text-primary-600 mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed">Workable offers low cost, quick deployment, and broad job board distribution. It&#x27;s made for lean teams but lacks the analytics and CRM depth needed for significant scale-up.</p></div><div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2"><div class="border-primary-100/40 flex items-center justify-center border-b p-6 sm:p-8 lg:border-r lg:border-b-0"><div class="relative w-full overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-gray-200 shadow-md"><img alt="Workable platform screenshot" loading="lazy" width="1024" height="600" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-auto w-full object-cover" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Falternatives%2Fashby%2Fworkable.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Falternatives%2Fashby%2Fworkable.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Falternatives%2Fashby%2Fworkable.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75"/></div></div><div class="p-6 sm:p-8"><div class="mb-6"><p class="mb-3 text-xs font-semibold tracking-wide text-emerald-700 uppercase">Features</p><ul class="space-y-2"><li class="text-primary-600 flex items-start gap-2 text-sm"><svg class="mt-0.5 h-3.5 w-3.5 flex-shrink-0 text-emerald-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>Ability to post to hundreds of job boards within the system</li><li class="text-primary-600 flex items-start gap-2 text-sm"><svg class="mt-0.5 h-3.5 w-3.5 flex-shrink-0 text-emerald-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>Templates and workflow presets that streamline setups</li><li class="text-primary-600 flex items-start gap-2 text-sm"><svg class="mt-0.5 h-3.5 w-3.5 flex-shrink-0 text-emerald-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>Supports employee referral programs</li></ul></div><div class="mb-6"><p class="mb-3 text-xs font-semibold tracking-wide text-amber-700 uppercase">Limitations</p><ul class="space-y-2"><li class="text-primary-500 flex items-start gap-2 text-sm"><span class="mt-1 flex h-3.5 w-3.5 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-amber-100"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-400"></span></span>Reliance on templates makes customization more challenging</li><li class="text-primary-500 flex items-start gap-2 text-sm"><span class="mt-1 flex h-3.5 w-3.5 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-amber-100"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-400"></span></span>Analytics and reporting capabilities aren&#x27;t as extensive as Lever&#x27;s</li><li class="text-primary-500 flex items-start gap-2 text-sm"><span class="mt-1 flex h-3.5 w-3.5 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-amber-100"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-400"></span></span>Add-on features and integrations significantly inflate the base price</li></ul></div><div class="border-primary-100/40 border-t pt-4"><p class="text-primary-700 text-sm font-medium"><span class="text-primary-900 font-semibold">Pricing:<!-- --> </span>Workable starts at $200/month for the Standard plan and $599/month for the Premier plan.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="scroll-reveal reveal-delay-2 border-primary-100/60 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border bg-white shadow-sm"><div class="border-primary-100/60 from-primary-50/50 border-b bg-gradient-to-r to-white px-6 py-5 sm:px-8"><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="bg-primary-100 text-primary-700 flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full text-sm font-bold">5</span><h3 class="text-primary-900 text-xl font-bold">Rippling</h3></div><p class="text-primary-600 mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed">Rippling combines recruiting with payroll, benefits, and HR. But because it&#x27;s built to do everything, its ATS is shallow, missing the CRM depth and analytics power serious hiring teams need.</p></div><div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2"><div class="border-primary-100/40 flex items-center justify-center border-b p-6 sm:p-8 lg:border-r lg:border-b-0"><div class="relative w-full overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-gray-200 shadow-md"><img alt="Rippling platform screenshot" loading="lazy" width="1024" height="600" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-auto w-full object-cover" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Falternatives%2Fashby%2Frippling.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Falternatives%2Fashby%2Frippling.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Falternatives%2Fashby%2Frippling.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75"/></div></div><div class="p-6 sm:p-8"><div class="mb-6"><p class="mb-3 text-xs font-semibold tracking-wide text-emerald-700 uppercase">Features</p><ul class="space-y-2"><li class="text-primary-600 flex items-start gap-2 text-sm"><svg class="mt-0.5 h-3.5 w-3.5 flex-shrink-0 text-emerald-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>Human capital management (HCM) software that automates tasks while preserving compliance</li><li class="text-primary-600 flex items-start gap-2 text-sm"><svg class="mt-0.5 h-3.5 w-3.5 flex-shrink-0 text-emerald-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>Ability to easily run payroll error-free and on time</li><li class="text-primary-600 flex items-start gap-2 text-sm"><svg class="mt-0.5 h-3.5 w-3.5 flex-shrink-0 text-emerald-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>Automated workflows to move candidates through hiring and into onboarding</li></ul></div><div class="mb-6"><p class="mb-3 text-xs font-semibold tracking-wide text-amber-700 uppercase">Limitations</p><ul class="space-y-2"><li class="text-primary-500 flex items-start gap-2 text-sm"><span class="mt-1 flex h-3.5 w-3.5 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-amber-100"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-400"></span></span>Too complex and bloated if you only need hiring support</li><li class="text-primary-500 flex items-start gap-2 text-sm"><span class="mt-1 flex h-3.5 w-3.5 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-amber-100"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-400"></span></span>Less suitable for high volume or enterprise scale</li><li class="text-primary-500 flex items-start gap-2 text-sm"><span class="mt-1 flex h-3.5 w-3.5 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-amber-100"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-400"></span></span>Some reviewers find Rippling offers a poor customer support experience</li></ul></div><div class="border-primary-100/40 border-t pt-4"><p class="text-primary-700 text-sm font-medium"><span class="text-primary-900 font-semibold">Pricing:<!-- --> </span>Reach out to Rippling directly for pricing information.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="bg-gray-50 py-20 lg:py-28"><div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><div class="scroll-reveal mb-12 text-center"><h2 class="text-primary-900 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl">Ashby Alternatives: FAQs</h2></div><div class="scroll-reveal"><div class="border-primary-200/60 border-b"><button class="flex w-full items-center justify-between py-6 text-left"><span class="text-primary-900 pr-8 text-lg font-semibold">Why look for an Ashby alternative?</span><span class="text-primary-700 flex-shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300 "><svg class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 4v16m8-8H4"></path></svg></span></button><div class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-400 ease-in-out max-h-0"><p class="text-primary-700 leading-relaxed">While Ashby offers numerous hiring features, it lacks the flexibility and breadth of features needed to scale sustainably. Common issues include limited workflow customization (e.g., single-stage approvals), shallow CRM and engagement tools compared to modern platforms, advanced DEI analytics that cost extra, and hidden costs from pricing and reliance on Zapier for integrations.</p></div></div><div class="border-primary-200/60 border-b"><button class="flex w-full items-center justify-between py-6 text-left"><span class="text-primary-900 pr-8 text-lg font-semibold">Which alternative is best for mid-market teams?</span><span class="text-primary-700 flex-shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300 "><svg class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 4v16m8-8H4"></path></svg></span></button><div class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-400 ease-in-out max-h-0"><p class="text-primary-700 leading-relaxed">Lever is the best option for dynamic hiring teams handling significant hiring volumes. It balances enterprise power with usability, making it ideal for mid-market companies and enterprises. Its unified ATS and CRM capabilities provide everything you need to connect with top candidates, all in one place. And if your needs expand, Lever adapts with you with predictable pricing.</p></div></div><div class="border-primary-200/60 border-b"><button class="flex w-full items-center justify-between py-6 text-left"><span class="text-primary-900 pr-8 text-lg font-semibold">How do we choose our ideal alternative to Ashby?</span><span class="text-primary-700 flex-shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300 "><svg class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 4v16m8-8H4"></path></svg></span></button><div class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-400 ease-in-out max-h-0"><p class="text-primary-700 leading-relaxed">Ask yourself these key questions: Does the platform have the features we need? Does it rely too heavily on add-ons? How extensive is the integration ecosystem, and does it sync with our must-have tools? What does it cost? Does the vendor offer comprehensive support? How strong are the reporting and analytics features? Is the platform built to last with automation and AI? How quickly can we implement and adopt it across our team?</p></div></div><div class="border-primary-200/60 border-b"><button class="flex w-full items-center justify-between py-6 text-left"><span class="text-primary-900 pr-8 text-lg font-semibold">How fast can we implement these tools?</span><span class="text-primary-700 flex-shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300 "><svg class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 4v16m8-8H4"></path></svg></span></button><div class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-400 ease-in-out max-h-0"><p class="text-primary-700 leading-relaxed">Specific implementation timelines vary by solution and your team&#x27;s capacity. Work with the customer success team to create an implementation plan that suits your needs. However, you should expect implementation to take at least a few weeks, so avoid planning any activities that require immediate use of the platform.</p></div></div></div><div class="mt-10 text-center"><a class="group inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full font-semibold transition-all bg-primary-700 text-white hover:bg-primary-800 hover:-translate-y-0.5 px-8 py-4 text-base shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl" href="/demo">Request a Demo<svg class="h-4 w-4 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3"></path></svg></a></div></div></section><section class="bg-white py-20 lg:py-28"><div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><div class="scroll-reveal mx-auto max-w-2xl text-center"><p class="text-primary-600 mb-3 text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] uppercase">Product Overview</p><h2 class="text-primary-900 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl">An ATS That Works Overtime (So You Don&#x27;t Have To)</h2></div><div class="scroll-reveal reveal-delay-1 mx-auto mt-12 max-w-5xl overflow-hidden rounded-2xl shadow-2xl"><div class="relative w-full overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-black" style="aspect-ratio:16 / 9"><button type="button"