@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Why look for an Ashby alternative?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"While Ashby offers numerous hiring features, it lacks the flexibility and breadth of features needed to scale sustainably. Common issues include limited workflow customization (e.g., single-stage approvals), shallow CRM and engagement tools compared to modern platforms, advanced DEI analytics that cost extra, and hidden costs from pricing and reliance on Zapier for integrations.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Which alternative is best for mid-market teams?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Lever is the best option for dynamic hiring teams handling significant hiring volumes. It balances enterprise power with usability, making it ideal for mid-market companies and enterprises. Its unified ATS and CRM capabilities provide everything you need to connect with top candidates, all in one place. And if your needs expand, Lever adapts with you with predictable pricing.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How do we choose our ideal alternative to Ashby?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Ask yourself these key questions: Does the platform have the features we need? Does it rely too heavily on add-ons? How extensive is the integration ecosystem, and does it sync with our must-have tools? What does it cost? Does the vendor offer comprehensive support? How strong are the reporting and analytics features? Is the platform built to last with automation and AI? How quickly can we implement and adopt it across our team?\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How fast can we implement these tools?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Specific implementation timelines vary by solution and your team's capacity. Work with the customer success team to create an implementation plan that suits your needs. However, you should expect implementation to take at least a few weeks, so avoid planning any activities that require immediate use of the platform.\"}}]}"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"0:{\"P\":null,\"b\":\"M3R-oGfnjedN0N_5A-Y38\",\"p\":\"\",\"c\":[\"\",\"alternative\",\"ashby-alternatives\"],\"i\":false,\"f\":[[[\"\",{\"children\":[\"alternative\",{\"children\":[\"ashby-alternatives\",{\"children\":[\"__PAGE__\",{}]}]}]},\"$undefined\",\"$undefined\",true],[\"\",[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"link\",\"0\",{\"rel\":\"stylesheet\",\"href\":\"/_next/static/css/137173194a16a70b.css?dpl=dpl_99aq39kAZsjt6gD7ruUrtrLM8jKQ\",\"precedence\":\"next\",\"crossOrigin\":\"$undefined\",\"nonce\":\"$undefined\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"1\",{\"rel\":\"stylesheet\",\"href\":\"/_next/static/css/01b9810251ebe960.css?dpl=dpl_99aq39kAZsjt6gD7ruUrtrLM8jKQ\",\"precedence\":\"next\",\"crossOrigin\":\"$undefined\",\"nonce\":\"$undefined\"}]],\"$L2\"]}],{\"children\":[\"alternative\",[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L3\",null,{\"parallelRouterKey\":\"children\",\"error\":\"$undefined\",\"errorStyles\":\"$undefined\",\"errorScripts\":\"$undefined\",\"template\":[\"$\",\"$L4\",null,{}],\"templateStyles\":\"$undefined\",\"templateScripts\":\"$undefined\",\"notFound\":\"$undefined\",\"forbidden\":\"$undefined\",\"unauthorized\":\"$undefined\"}]]}],{\"children\":[\"ashby-alternatives\",[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[null,[[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https://schema.org\\\",\\\"@type\\\":\\\"BreadcrumbList\\\",\\\"itemListElement\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":1,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Home\\\",\\\"item\\\":\\\"https://www.lever.co\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":2,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Alternative\\\",\\\"item\\\":\\\"https://www.lever.co/alternative\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":3,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Ashby Alternatives\\\",\\\"item\\\":\\\"https://www.lever.co/alternative/ashby-alternatives\\\"}]}\"}}],[\"$\",\